 takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yuFodWP6Eo4Q7kNvwFq45Sy&_nc_oc=Adp_S57ttt-oeM2j7iGIdyNO6JmIj_pVRK8JAgslmwxbi8ZmuwuE-oulfGVWOt63Tdc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLIDKBhjr1LlrH2xk3gAAOPlfDffCQzKHI6pd7l3mslIQ&oe=6AAEA7C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GRBgfHQB4FEQ7kNvwH9yNX6&_nc_oc=AdqcU1W-vieLDZ3mgOifm7QmWHXjRUt0uaZ2f-hNzHGH46ZGZz8q-2_kZ13yqNWKpu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLLluV7tcTiFw-pJZHPV-II8Tis0GMIeswO7ZyOB95Zcg&oe=6AAEB526"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C1t_qXd4VLcQ7kNvwEQ_VY7&_nc_oc=Ado1dLSzia2dVN0lU1zhEUu11ER2i1B2r6gdz7ncpgGklCeaHnBhuyMk8aCtD-iFP8E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLly0er2fmC6aBckBFq-ykX8ZGWuJkDcLmsh